{"id":"solitude","lemma":"solitude","pos":"noun","rank":2903,"glosses":["solitude","loneliness"],"ipa":"/sɔ.li.tyd/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/98/Fr-solitude.ogg/Fr-solitude.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"solitudes"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis seul, mais je ne souffre pas de solitude.","en":"I'm alone, but I'm not lonely.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"alone"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to suffer","l":"souffrir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Je ne gère pas bien la solitude.","en":"I don't handle loneliness well.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to manage","l":"gérer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Quel est le meilleur remède contre la solitude ?","en":"What's the best cure for loneliness?","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"best, better"},{"g":"remedy"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Il n'y a rien de pire que la solitude.","en":"There's nothing worse than loneliness.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"worse, worst"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Le sentiment de solitude et le fait d'être seul ne sont pas la même chose.","en":"Loneliness and being alone are not the same thing.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"a sentiment"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"alone"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"same"},{"g":"thing"}]}]}